<h1>Search</h1>
<p><code>&lt;gcds-ext-mws-search&gt;</code> provides a standalone Canada.ca search form with accessible query suggestions fetched as a person types. It is based on <a href="https://design-system.canada.ca/en/components/search/" target="_blank">GCDS's search component</a>. This version adds the following properties:</p>
<ul class="list-disc mb-300">
  <li><code>suggestions-access-token</code></li>
  <li><code>suggestions-organization-id</code></li>
  <li><code>suggestions-max-items</code></li>
  <li><code>suggestions-min-characters</code></li>
  <li><code>suggestions-pipeline</code></li>
  <li><code>suggestions-search-hub</code></li>
  <li><code>suggestions-endpoint</code></li>
</ul>
<p>All of those properties are used to configure the search suggestions.</p>

<h2>Configure suggestions (default)</h2>
<p>An access token is the only mandatory property to display suggestions.</p>
<gcds-ext-mws-search 
  action="https://www.canada.ca/en/sr.html"
  suggestions-access-token="xx27395007-5c98-43c0-bef0-553131a34e90"></gcds-ext-mws-search>

<gcds-details details-title="Code sample">
{% highlight "html" %}
<gcds-ext-mws-search
  action="https://www.canada.ca/en/sr.html"
  suggestions-access-token="xx27395007-5c98-43c0-bef0-553131a34e90"
></gcds-ext-mws-search>
{% endhighlight %}
</gcds-details>

<h2>Configure suggestions (custom)</h2>
<p>You can adjust the number of suggestions displayed and the minimum number of characters required to trigger suggestions. The rest of the properties should remain unchanged for most use cases.</p>
<gcds-ext-mws-search 
  action="https://www.canada.ca/en/sr.html"
  suggestions-access-token="xx27395007-5c98-43c0-bef0-553131a34e90"
  suggestions-max-items="10"
  suggestions-min-characters="5"
></gcds-ext-mws-search>

<gcds-details details-title="Code sample">
{% highlight "html" %}
<gcds-ext-mws-search
  action="https://www.canada.ca/en/sr.html"
